== Std.Terminal (r3.88, F2): a runtime error gives the terminal back before
== its message (colors reset, cursor shown). MoveTo counts from 1: row 0
== stops the program with "value out of range".
Use Std.Terminal

Main :
    ShowCursor(False)
    SetColor(Yellow, Black)
    Put("z")
    Row Integer := 0
    MoveTo(Row, 1)
    PutLn("never")
;
